<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<!--HEAD-->
</head>
<body>
<p>Project ID: 1. Install the web, React Native, or Flutter SDK using a client token issued by your backend.</p>
<details>
<summary>Register an app</summary>
<form action="/api/embedded_action" method="post">
<input type="hidden" name="organization" value="alice">
<input type="hidden" name="project" value="pocketbook">
<input type="hidden" name="action" value="register">
<!>
<label>App name<input name="name" required maxlength="120">
</label>
<label>Account namespace<input name="namespace" required maxlength="120" placeholder="customer-accounts">
</label>
<p>Use the same account namespace when web and mobile share user accounts and votes.</p>
<label>Surfaces<select name="surfaces">
<option value="both">Web and mobile</option>
<option value="web">Web</option>
<option value="mobile">Mobile</option>
</select>
</label>
<label>Allowed website origins, one per line<textarea name="origins" rows="3" placeholder="https://app.example.com">
</textarea>
</label>
<button type="submit" class="button-primary">Create backend credential</button>
</form>
</details>
<!>
<details>
<summary>Connect a local or self-hosted agent</summary>
<p>Create a pairing code for your worker. Codes expire after ten minutes and can be used once.</p>
<form action="/api/embedded_action" method="post">
<input type="hidden" name="organization" value="alice">
<input type="hidden" name="project" value="pocketbook">
<input type="hidden" name="action" value="pair_worker">
<!>
<label>Worker name<input name="name" required maxlength="120">
</label>
<label>Repository<select name="repository" required>
<option value="alice/web">alice/web</option>
<!>
</select>
</label>
<button type="submit">Create pairing code</button>
</form>
</details>
<!>
<h3>Planning</h3>
<p>New eligible feature requests are planned automatically. Every implementation still needs your approval.</p>
<form action="/api/embedded_action" method="post">
<input type="hidden" name="organization" value="alice">
<input type="hidden" name="project" value="pocketbook">
<input type="hidden" name="action" value="policy">
<!>
<input type="hidden" name="automatic" value="false">
<label>Repository<select name="repository" required>
<option value="alice/web">alice/web</option>
<!>
</select>
</label>
<label>Maximum plans per day<input type="number" name="daily_limit" min="1" max="100" value="10" required>
</label>
<button type="submit">Use manual selection</button>
</form>
<p>Automatic planning waits for complete triage and skips bugs, held reports, and duplicates. Existing requests are planned only when you select them.</p>
<form action="/api/embedded_action" method="post">
<input type="hidden" name="organization" value="alice">
<input type="hidden" name="project" value="pocketbook">
<input type="hidden" name="action" value="plan">
<!>
<label>Request<select name="id" required>
<!>
</select>
</label>
<label>Repository<select name="repository" required>
<option value="alice/web">alice/web</option>
<!>
</select>
</label>
<button type="submit">Generate plan</button>
</form>
<!>
<!>
</body>
</html>
